Dashboard: drop the per-expansion world-boss meta entry from raid lists

Each expansion raid tier in the Encounter Journal carries a world-boss
meta entry named after the expansion itself (Pandaria, Draenor, Midnight)
instead of a real raid. It has no weekly lockout, so it should not appear
as a raid column. Drop any raid entry whose label matches its tier name
(exactly, or as the trailing word for long tier names like Mists of
Pandaria -> Pandaria), mirroring the Keystone Dungeons filter on the
dungeon side.

